WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.300 line:6%
Still searching and getting options?

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.400 line:6%
Ask. Don't search.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.800 line:6%
Ask, and get answers.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.400 line:6%
One verified answer instead of a list of links.

5
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.200
A helper bar appears at the top of ISSF.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.500
On the first visit, a short tip introduces it.

7
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.600
Just type your question in your own words.

8
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.100
The answer comes from the rules and manuals of the Slovak Football Association, with sources.

9
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.400
If the answer doesn't help, click Write to the helpdesk.

10
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.200
The question is carried over into a message, and a person replies by e-mail.

11
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:51.200
The bar folds into a small button you can move anywhere on the screen.

12
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.800
It remembers where you put it.

13
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:58.800
The bulb brings the tip back at any time, and a double-click returns the bar to its place.
